    "The old all-dynamic 1274 artifact bypasses the instrumented per-shard dispatcher; old D/B/N are unavailable, not zero. Whole-mask measurements remain valid.",
    "The 257 hybrid keeps the small parent boundary static. The larger configuration has dynamic component domains of 5 and 1274 original IDs.",
    "The old trunk did not include the already-developed reduced-vocabulary runtime. Large trunk gains are not additional gains over the previous experimental checkpoint.",
    "Shared-host A/A variability prevents a claim about small precise percentage differences. Raw runs are retained in the recovery archive."
